  "intention": "Break the loop by refusing to repeat the same physical sequence and verbal confirmation.",
  "detail": "You pull the heavy hotel duvet over your head and close your eyes. The delivery van backfires twice in the distance, a harsh, metallic cough against the silence of the room. You do not reach for the phone. You do not check the envelope. You simply lie still, letting the Tuesday morning air settle around you, refusing to ride the coach, refusing to call your sister, and refusing to verify the van. For the first time, you choose to let the day pass without your intervention, watching to see if the loop holds or if the stillness creates a crack in the day."
